#. module: l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue
#: model:ai.skill,name:l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue.skill_bg_erp_correction_safety
msgid "bg-erp-correction-safety"
msgstr "bg-erp-correction-safety"

#. module: l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue
#: model:ai.skill,description:l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue.skill_bg_erp_correction_safety
msgid ""
"[en_US]\n"
"Activate at the START of ANY data correction (write/create/unlink/raw\n"
"SQL) on a Bulgarian Odoo accounting or stock record — account.move,\n"
"stock.move, stock.valuation.layer, stock.quant, sale.order. Signals:\n"
"the task is a manual fix of posted/done data, a backdated journal\n"
"entry, an SVL/quant realign, or an inter-company flow. Establishes the\n"
"hard guardrails before the domain skill runs.\n"
"[/en_US]\n"
"[bg_BG]\n"
"Активира се в НАЧАЛОТО на ВСЯКА корекция на данни (write/create/unlink/\n"
"raw SQL) върху българско Odoo счетоводство или склад — account.move,\n"
"stock.move, stock.valuation.layer, stock.quant, sale.order. Сигнали:\n"
"ръчна поправка на posted/done данни, backdated журнална статия,\n"
"SVL/quant realign, inter-company поток. Дефинира guardrail-ите преди\n"
"домейн skill-а.\n"
"[/bg_BG]"
msgstr ""
"[en_US]\n"
"Activate at the START of ANY data correction (write/create/unlink/raw\n"
"SQL) on a Bulgarian Odoo accounting or stock record — account.move,\n"
"stock.move, stock.valuation.layer, stock.quant, sale.order. Signals:\n"
"the task is a manual fix of posted/done data, a backdated journal\n"
"entry, an SVL/quant realign, or an inter-company flow. Establishes the\n"
"hard guardrails before the domain skill runs.\n"
"[/en_US]\n"
"[bg_BG]\n"
"Активира се в НАЧАЛОТО на ВСЯКА корекция на данни (write/create/unlink/\n"
"raw SQL) върху българско Odoo счетоводство или склад — account.move,\n"
"stock.move, stock.valuation.layer, stock.quant, sale.order. Сигнали:\n"
"ръчна поправка на posted/done данни, backdated журнална статия,\n"
"SVL/quant realign, inter-company поток. Дефинира guardrail-ите преди\n"
"домейн skill-а.\n"
"[/bg_BG]"

#. module: l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue
#: model:ai.skill,name:l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue.skill_bg_intercompany_transit_cogs
msgid "bg-intercompany-transit-cogs"
msgstr "bg-intercompany-transit-cogs"

#. module: l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue
#: model:ai.skill,description:l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue.skill_bg_intercompany_transit_cogs
msgid ""
"[en_US]\n"
"Activate when a stock delivery to a related party flows through an\n"
"inter-company transit location and the COGS journal entry is missing or\n"
"the delivery was created with the wrong picking type (transit instead of\n"
"a delivery order). Signals: SO with intercompany dropship/transit route,\n"
"counterpart company in the group, SVL without account_move_id.\n"
"[/en_US]\n"
"[bg_BG]\n"
"Активира се когато складова доставка към свързано лице минава през\n"
"inter-company transit локация и липсва COGS статия, или доставката е с\n"
"грешен picking type (transit вместо delivery order). Сигнали: SO с\n"
"intercompany dropship/transit route, counterpart фирма в групата, SVL\n"
"без account_move_id.\n"
"[/bg_BG]"
msgstr ""
"[en_US]\n"
"Activate when a stock delivery to a related party flows through an\n"
"inter-company transit location and the COGS journal entry is missing or\n"
"the delivery was created with the wrong picking type (transit instead of\n"
"a delivery order). Signals: SO with intercompany dropship/transit route,\n"
"counterpart company in the group, SVL without account_move_id.\n"
"[/en_US]\n"
"[bg_BG]\n"
"Активира се когато складова доставка към свързано лице минава през\n"
"inter-company transit локация и липсва COGS статия, или доставката е с\n"
"грешен picking type (transit вместо delivery order). Сигнали: SO с\n"
"intercompany dropship/transit route, counterpart фирма в групата, SVL\n"
"без account_move_id.\n"
"[/bg_BG]"

#. module: l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue
#: model:ai.skill,name:l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue.skill_bg_so_phantom_qty_delivered
msgid "bg-so-phantom-qty-delivered"
msgstr "bg-so-phantom-qty-delivered"

#. module: l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue
#: model:ai.skill,description:l10n_bg_ai_accounting_glue.skill_bg_so_phantom_qty_delivered
msgid ""
"[en_US]\n"
"Activate before raising or editing the quantity of a confirmed/locked\n"
"sale.order.line that has a phantom qty_delivered (qty_delivered &gt; 0\n"
"while its picking is only confirmed/assigned with no done move). Editing\n"
"product_uom_qty in that state auto-dones the original move (draft COGS +\n"
"backdated SVL) and launches a delta procurement, often into the wrong\n"
"warehouse.\n"
"[/en_US]\n"
"[bg_BG]\n"
"Активира се преди вдигане/редакция на количество на confirmed/locked\n"
"sale.order.line с фантомен qty_delivered (qty_delivered &gt; 0, докато\n"
"picking-ът е само confirmed/assigned, без done move). Запис на\n"
"product_uom_qty в това състояние auto-done-ва оригиналния move (draft\n"
"COGS + backdated SVL) и пуска delta procurement, често в грешен склад.\n"
"[/bg_BG]"
msgstr ""
"[en_US]\n"
"Activate before raising or editing the quantity of a confirmed/locked\n"
"sale.order.line that has a phantom qty_delivered (qty_delivered &gt; 0\n"
"while its picking is only confirmed/assigned with no done move). Editing\n"
"product_uom_qty in that state auto-dones the original move (draft COGS +\n"
"backdated SVL) and launches a delta procurement, often into the wrong\n"
"warehouse.\n"
"[/en_US]\n"
"[bg_BG]\n"
"Активира се преди вдигане/редакция на количество на confirmed/locked\n"
"sale.order.line с фантомен qty_delivered (qty_delivered &gt; 0, докато\n"
"picking-ът е само confirmed/assigned, без done move). Запис на\n"
"product_uom_qty в това състояние auto-done-ва оригиналния move (draft\n"
"COGS + backdated SVL) и пуска delta procurement, често в грешен склад.\n"
"[/bg_BG]"
